data: {"type": "answer", "text": "You have watched 7 movies featuring Idris Elba:\n\n* **Thor** (2011) \u2013 as Heimdall\n* **Thor: The Dark World** (2013) \u2013 as Heimdall\n* **Zootopia** (2016) \u2013 as Chief Bogo (voice)\n* **Thor: Ragnarok** (2017) \u2013 as Heimdall\n* **The Suicide Squad** (2021) \u2013 as Bloodsport\n* **Thor: Love and Thunder** (2022) \u2013 as Heimdall\n* **Zootopia 2** (2025) \u2013 as Chief Bogo (voice)", "iteration": 2, "films": [{"tmdb_id": 10195, "title": "Thor", "year": 2011, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.5, "vote_average": 6.8, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/prSfAi1xGrhLQNxVSUFh61xQ4Qy.jpg", "overview": "Against his father Odin's will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth."}, {"tmdb_id": 76338, "title": "Thor: The Dark World", "year": 2013, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.0, "vote_average": 6.508, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wp6OxE4poJ4G7c0U2ZIXasTSMR7.jpg", "overview": "Thor fights to restore order across the cosmos\u2026 but an ancient race led by the vengeful Malekith returns to plunge the universe back into darkness. Faced with an enemy that even Odin and Asgard cannot withstand, Thor must embark on his most perilous and personal journey yet, one that will reunite him with Jane Foster and force him to sacrifice everything to save us all."}, {"tmdb_id": 269149, "title": "Zootopia", "year": 2016, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.5, "vote_average": 7.765, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hlK0e0wAQ3VLuJcsfIYPvb4JVud.jpg", "overview": "Determined to prove herself, Officer Judy Hopps, the first bunny on Zootopia's police force, jumps at the chance to crack her first case - even if it means partnering with scam-artist fox Nick Wilde to solve the mystery."}, {"tmdb_id": 284053, "title": "Thor: Ragnarok", "year": 2017, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.0, "vote_average": 7.58, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg", "overview": "Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela."}, {"tmdb_id": 436969, "title": "The Suicide Squad", "year": 2021, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.5, "vote_average": 7.445, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/q61qEyssk2ku3okWICKArlAdhBn.jpg", "overview": "Supervillains Harley Quinn, Bloodsport, Peacemaker and a collection of nutty cons at Belle Reve prison join the super-secret, super-shady Task Force X as they are dropped off at the remote, enemy-infused island of Corto Maltese."}, {"tmdb_id": 616037, "title": "Thor: Love and Thunder", "year": 2022, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.0, "vote_average": 6.358, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg", "overview": "After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher\u2019s vengeance and stop him before it\u2019s too late."}, {"tmdb_id": 1084242, "title": "Zootopia 2", "year": 2025, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.0, "vote_average": 7.674, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg", "overview": "After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia's history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before."}]}

